## Onboarding Buddy Program

### Buddy Responsibilities

| Task | Frequency |
|------|-----------|
| Daily check-in (first 2 weeks) | Daily |
| Lunch/coffee dates | 2x per week (Month 1) |
| Answer questions/be resource | As needed |
| Introduce to team/company | Ongoing |
| Cultural guidance | Ongoing |
| Bi-weekly 1:1 (Month 2-3) | Every 2 weeks |

### Buddy Selection Criteria
- 6+ months tenure at MedSync
- Same or adjacent department
- Different team (for broader exposure)
- "Meets" or higher performance rating
- Volunteer for role

### Buddy Training
- 2-hour certification program
- Onboarding best practices
- Conversation guides provided
- Recognition for participation

---

## Manager Responsibilities

### Before Day 1
- [ ] Announce new hire to team
- [ ] Prepare desk/equipment order
- [ ] Create 30-60-90 day plan
- [ ] Schedule key meetings for Week 1
- [ ] Assign onboarding buddy
- [ ] Prepare welcome message

### Week 1
- [ ] Day 1 welcome meeting (30 min)
- [ ] Set up daily standups
- [ ] Introduce to immediate team
- [ ] Review 30-day goals
- [ ] Week 1 feedback session

### Month 1
- [ ] Weekly 1:1s (30-60 min)
- [ ] 30-day formal check-in
- [ ] Initial feedback delivery
- [ ] Goals and expectations alignment

### Month 2-3
- [ ] Bi-weekly 1:1s
- [ ] 60-day check-in
- [ ] 90-day formal review
- [ ] Performance rating (meets expectations for role)

